 (md5('news_architecture_price_first_polymarket_20260719')::uuid, 'private', 'private', 'architecture',
  'Arquitetura de news / external factors price-first + coletor Polymarket (2026-07-18/19, tudo gratis)',
  'Doutrina Cris = price-first (o preco move ANTES dos feeds; news de alto impacto deve acionar rapido). alert-bridge/news_gate.py = gate unificado advisory (informa, NUNCA bloqueia), lido pelo E0; high_impact_now = BREAKING so (news fresca / choque de preco / release agendado). oil-shock e guerra-em-curso = contexto persistente, nao ligam breaking 24/7. GATILHO rapido sub-minuto: price_shock (tape 15M, 30s) + finnhub_gld_ws (WebSocket GLD ticks, so horas US), ambos Telegram gated por L1_PRODUCTION_AUTHORIZED (send_telegram NAO tem gate proprio, o caller gateia). CONTEXTO fresco lane 4min run_news_cycle.sh: finnhub_news (Reuters-tier) + geopolitical (GDELT keyless) + investinglive (RSS) + oil (FMP Brent) + polymarket -> news_escalate (escala 1x a headline breaking mais fresca, dedup+cooldown 10min, gate NEWS_ALERTS_AUTHORIZED, exclui price_shock/GLD que auto-alertam). CONTEXTO lento: fj_stream_ws (FinancialJuice WebSocket, FREE=10min atraso, nunca breaking) + POLYMARKET (novo 2026-07-19, Gamma API keyless): odds forward-looking dos drivers do ouro (Fed no-change, invasao Ira, Ormuz, recessao); filtro macro/geopolitico client-side; edge = o DELTA (shift >=5pp = evento a ser precificado antes do preco, entra no advisory, nunca liga breaking). Fincept avaliado -> so a ideia reusada, zero codigo deles. Watchdog = 17 componentes (inclui Bar-store, PriceShock, GLD-ws, FJ-ws, EF news, Polymarket, Receiver, Cloudflared). Segredos FINNHUB/FJ em root .env chmod 600 gitignored (FJ key foi exposta no chat, Cris deve rodar); Polymarket keyless. Commits 30045ce/4bdefb2/e13c44a/bbad1d6/c1d9ad5.',
